<title>USA: Select to restructure Channel America.</title>
<headline>Select to restructure Channel America.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Select Capital Advisors Inc said on Tuesday it retained Marathon Media Management Co to help it restructure Channel America Broadcasting Inc.</p>
<p>Channel is the holding company for Channel America Network Inc, a network of television affilate stations. It recently retained Select Capital to help with its restructuring efforts.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
